{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Strigoi: The Vampire Legend",
    "steam_appid": 3081670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We, my sister and I, have long lived abroad, together with the longing for our homeland. Not long ago, we received an invitation to a party in Romania, in the Carpathians. My sister, without hesitation, got into the car and left. I refused to go, but after some time I received a terrifying message from my sister. Frightened, I dropped everything and quickly set out to find her. I wonder what happened?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strigoi is a first-person horror shooter set in the Carpathian Mountains. You will face various enemies (Vampires, Strigoi...), encounter interesting puzzles, and find different items that will help you overcome obstacles and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-open world with various interesting locations such as Mountains, Dungeons, a Village, Graveyards, an Abandoned Castle, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous and terrifying enemies for whom you are merely food and an unwelcome guest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep storyline where you must unravel the mysteries of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game world filled with dangers, including not only enemies but also traps and puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We, my sister and I, have long lived abroad, together with the longing for our homeland. Not long ago, we received an invitation to a party in Romania, in the Carpathians. My sister, without hesitation, got into the car and left. I refused to go, but after some time I received a terrifying message from my sister. Frightened, I dropped everything and quickly set out to find her. I wonder what happened?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strigoi is a first-person horror shooter set in the Carpathian Mountains. You will face various enemies (Vampires, Strigoi...), encounter interesting puzzles, and find different items that will help you overcome obstacles and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-open world with various interesting locations such as Mountains, Dungeons, a Village, Graveyards, an Abandoned Castle, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous and terrifying enemies for whom you are merely food and an unwelcome guest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep storyline where you must unravel the mysteries of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game world filled with dangers, including not only enemies but also traps and puzzles.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Strigoi is a first-person horror shooter set in the Carpathian Mountains. You will face various enemies (Vampires, Strigoi...), encounter interesting puzzles, and find different items that will help you overcome obstacles and enemies.",
